            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The metadata file is unreadable or has an unsupported format. It has not been overwritten. Restore a valid metadata backup and reopen CodexM."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "元数据文件无法读取或格式不受支持。文件未被覆盖。请恢复有效的元数据备份后重新打开 CodexM。"
          }
